VALUES ('4d130a0a-6230-4b94-b234-da43611c37f8', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000400', 'Abraham Lincoln won the presidential election in the year 1860. He amended the constitution. Lincoln and the Republicans promised to prevent the spread of slavery into newly incorporated territories. Shortly after the election of Abraham Lincoln, eleven southern states formed the Confederacy led by Jefferson Davis, a rich plantation owner, and declared secession. This resulted in the 1861 outbreak of civil war which ended in 1865.', 'G10-History-STB-2023-web.pdf p.1', '2026.1', 'published', '[0.0076420964,0.01294889,0.014751612,-0.00061496807,0.013828814,-0.0077154622,-0.0071167736,0.012971817,0.00993033,-0.10453331,-0.049435705,-0.0083045615,0.04809897,0.04992638,-0.018198466,-0.039756726,0.0074641285,0.014739485,0.010821077,-0.008964845,0.004337184,-0.04712515,-0.00042192446,-0.047449127,-0.04355751,0.0037751342,-0.078608066,-0.05564463,0.005444376,0.18496777,-0.023380278,-0.0044747447,-0.0019407483,0.017766194,-0.028566405,-0.010280818,-0.0065114493,0.0033001322,-0.030261263,0.021682385,0.0013447256,0.0039471635,0.024337605,-0.011649322,-0.0034885462,-0.04047514,0.009542963,0.02834292,0.0109813595,-0.005474726,0.026277816,0.032123588,0.025070705,-0.03851786,0.026237579,-0.005159273,-0.037215006,-0.009830407,0.025768027,-0.012196776,0.00036065973,0.048129737,-0.008288313,0.032096162,-0.027796615,-0.011915196,0.039731957,-0.08690161,0.0052233217,0.028916307,-0.004283501,-0.020436006,-0.008520173,0.020049887,-0.043104053,0.012129982,-0.044612195,0.003254006,0.03134441,0.040955987,0.059465215,0.020719333,-0.0025620717,0.039721027,0.02790614,0.00060119125,0.003698966,-0.018925088,0.022431606,0.0120056085,-0.03280056,0.013307843,0.03224758,-0.048868965,0.046471164,-0.008481193,-0.011017173,-0.0073578833,0.045085013,0.0045925607,0.012571906,0.0035964765,0.039335016,0.045269534,0.007860573,-0.018997258,-0.012540546,0.004287414,0.051913954,0.045816023,-0.020310817,-0.31566998,-0.05036