VALUES ('ca2022fd-1e63-4fc6-85b9-074a0d050696', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000400', 'They cooperated and united as vital element in the attainment of their set goals. Missionaries in critical times of need, depended on traders for funds, and relied completely on administrators for physical security and protection. However, European missionaries preaching Christianity in Africa in the last two decades of the nineteenth century converted only less than 1% of non-Muslim Africans (outside Ethiopia) to Christianity. Because of their lack of success, the missionaries began to appeal to their respective European governments for help.', 'G10-History-STB-2023-web.pdf p.1', '2026.1', 'published', '[-0.024552103,0.024715276,-0.07124216,0.00969485,0.0021085313,-0.009227352,0.024388617,-0.02524957,0.010646856,-0.11221845,-0.033838738,0.00417578,0.02332141,0.017715508,-0.012378793,-0.020353677,0.027679866,0.019633593,-0.0054523726,0.061045207,0.05517874,-0.0011703804,0.035648756,-0.0005775803,-0.021822667,0.026605757,-0.034088973,-0.031244522,-0.0076498496,0.18364817,-0.03886771,0.016864728,-0.0058919895,-0.013182018,-0.045392495,0.0019814717,-0.00072701403,-0.04698603,0.009017631,-0.013161659,-0.0051262747,0.044667263,-0.06792887,0.014120783,0.034891248,-0.018898815,-0.0024672819,0.0038520375,0.004331311,0.0014267667,-0.0073578097,-0.005256215,0.029234411,-0.05551294,0.028672019,0.048523244,-0.020332014,0.02820247,0.012546073,0.037232827,-0.0007030915,0.0021422894,-0.038864166,0.02850237,0.005598059,0.011958636,0.006510256,-0.02659154,0.020640189,-0.015933832,0.0018816805,-0.011247041,0.037830178,-0.00023813824,0.0070662643,0.03430768,-0.04377059,-0.011373593,0.045582984,-0.00023171197,0.021646217,0.010741902,-0.019669676,-0.0019951735,-0.0065126843,0.016003875,-0.022671284,-0.060684357,-0.010092172,-0.029175667,-0.007941126,0.027336475,0.072930075,-0.04819005,-0.0020206135,0.0024296087,0.005762105,-0.032503575,-0.008539759,-0.018436596,-0.014122642,0.008402432,0.049456157,0